      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.3,
          "end": 4.61,
          "en": "So now that we saw hooks in action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.61,
          "end": 8.983,
          "en": "why could they be better or nicer than mixins?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.83,
          "end": 12.28,
          "en": "Well, I see two main advantages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.28,
          "end": 15.39,
          "en": "For one, it's easy to make them configurable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.39,
          "end": 17.12,
          "en": "As you saw in the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.12,
          "end": 19.55,
          "en": "adding extra parameters is easy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.55,
          "end": 22.83,
          "en": "and all of a sudden, your hook is very versatile",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.83,
          "end": 25.46,
          "en": "and can be used in different components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.46,
          "end": 28.433,
          "en": "with different configurations, which is great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.52,
          "end": 33.81,
          "en": "In addition, they fixed one major flaw mixins have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.81,
          "end": 37.38,
          "en": "With mixins, I mentioned that in bigger apps with more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.38,
          "end": 40.98,
          "en": "and more mixins, it's hard to see which data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.98,
          "end": 43.95,
          "en": "and which method is added by which mixin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.95,
          "end": 46.15,
          "en": "With custom hooks, that's easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.15,
          "end": 48.49,
          "en": "I mean, the custom hook returns",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.49,
          "end": 51.13,
          "en": "the things it wants to expose to a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.13,
          "end": 54.01,
          "en": "and therefore, we have to accept these things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.01,
          "end": 56.4,
          "en": "like here, where we get an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.4,
          "end": 59.08,
          "en": "and pull the things we need out of the array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.08,
          "end": 61.41,
          "en": "and store them in constants.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.41,
          "end": 65.4,
          "en": "It's super easy to see that alertIsVisible, showAlert,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.4,
          "end": 68.493,
          "en": "and hideAlert are coming from the useAlert hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.38,
          "end": 72.86,
          "en": "So even if we would be using 10 or 20 custom hooks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.86,
          "end": 76.95,
          "en": "it would always be easy to immediately see which feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.95,
          "end": 80.02,
          "en": "and which data piece is coming from which hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.02,
          "end": 82.53999999999999,
          "en": "And that can be a major advantage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.53999999999999,
          "end": 84.93299999999999,
          "en": "in bigger apps and bigger components.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
